<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Paper C · Answer guide</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-1/c/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 1 Course Review · Original Paper C</p><h1>Paper C · Answer guide</h1><p>40 listening/reading questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks. Independent course-review draft.</p><p class="note">Printable materials and answer references. Open the workspace to practise with section clocks and local recording. Writing and speaking need manual review.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Paper C</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><nav class="links"><a href="#listening">Listening</a><a href="#reading">Reading</a><a href="#writing">Writing</a><a href="#speaking">Speaking</a></nav><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="listening">Listening · 15 minutes</h2><h3>L1 · Questions 1–5</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q1"><h3>1. Who helps the speaker practise Chinese?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m01.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 姐姐的中文很好。每天晚饭后，她陪我练中文。那时妈妈在厨房洗碗，弟弟在客厅看电视，不和我们一起练。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 姐姐</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 弟弟</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 妈妈</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The older sister practises Chinese with the speaker.</p><p class="cn">姐姐晚饭后陪说话者练中文。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 每天晚饭后，她陪我练中文</p><ul><li>B: The younger brother watches television and does not join them.<br>弟弟看电视，不和他们一起练。</li><li>C: The mother is washing dishes, not practising with the speaker.<br>妈妈在厨房洗碗，没有陪说话者练中文。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q2"><h3>2. Who will go with the speaker to visit Grandmother?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m02.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 奶奶一个人住在南京。明天我和爸爸坐车去看她，妈妈要工作，不能一起去。我们星期天晚上回来。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 妈妈</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 爷爷</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 爸爸</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The speaker explicitly travels with Dad.</p><p class="cn">说话者明确说和爸爸一起去。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 明天我和爸爸坐车去看她</p><ul><li>A: The mother has work and cannot go.<br>妈妈要工作，不能一起去。</li><li>B: The grandfather is not described as going.<br>材料没有说爷爷同行。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q3"><h3>3. Whose birthday is it today?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m03.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 今天是妈妈的生日。我和爸爸买了一个蛋糕，姐姐准备晚饭。妈妈下班回家以后，我们一起给她唱生日歌。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 姐姐</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 妈妈</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 爸爸</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The opening sentence states that today is Mum’s birthday.</p><p class="cn">开头直接说明今天是妈妈生日。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 今天是妈妈的生日</p><ul><li>A: The sister prepares dinner; it is not her birthday.<br>姐姐准备晚饭，今天不是她的生日。</li><li>C: Dad helps buy the cake but is not the birthday person.<br>爸爸帮忙买蛋糕，不是过生日的人。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q4"><h3>4. In which city does the speaker live now?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m04.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 我现在和爸爸妈妈住在天津。哥哥在上海工作，爷爷奶奶住在北京。我们放假的时候常常去北京看他们。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 上海</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 北京</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 天津</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The speaker lives with the parents in Tianjin.</p><p class="cn">说话者现在与父母住在天津。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我现在和爸爸妈妈住在天津</p><ul><li>A: The older brother works in Shanghai.<br>上海是哥哥工作的城市。</li><li>B: The grandparents live in Beijing.<br>爷爷奶奶住在北京。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q5"><h3>5. Which subject is the FIRST lesson on Monday?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m05.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 星期一上午第一节是数学课，第二节才是中文课。下午有体育课。今天我先把数学书拿出来，中文书还放在书包里。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 数学</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 中文</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 体育</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>Mathematics is explicitly the first lesson.</p><p class="cn">原文明确说第一节是数学课。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 第一节是数学课</p><ul><li>B: Chinese is the second lesson.<br>中文是第二节课。</li><li>C: PE takes place in the afternoon, not first.<br>体育课在下午，不是上午第一节。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>L2 · Questions 6–10</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q6"><h3>6. What is in the red box?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m06.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 老师，我的橡皮找不到了。</p><p class="cn">male · 黑板旁边的红盒子里有橡皮，你拿一块吧。</p><p class="cn">female · 谢谢，我用完以后放回盒子。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 铅笔</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 橡皮</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 尺子</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The teacher says the red box contains erasers.</p><p class="cn">老师说明红盒子里有橡皮。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 红盒子里有橡皮</p><ul><li>A: The box is not described as containing pencils.<br>老师没有说红盒子里有铅笔。</li><li>C: No ruler is mentioned as being in the box.<br>老师没有提到盒子里有尺子。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q7"><h3>7. Where should the student write the answers?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m07.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 老师，今天的答案写在书上吗？</p><p class="cn">female · 不要写在书上，写在本子上。写完以后把本子交给我，书先放在桌子上。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 书上</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 黑板上</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 本子上</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The answers should be written in the notebook.</p><p class="cn">老师让学生写在本子上。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 写在本子上</p><ul><li>A: The teacher explicitly says not to write in the book.<br>老师明确说不要写在书上。</li><li>B: The board is not the requested writing surface.<br>老师没有要求写在黑板上。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q8"><h3>8. Whose book has been found?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m08.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 老师，这本书是谁的？不是我的，我的在书包里。</p><p class="cn">male · 我看看，上面写着小陈的名字。请你下课后把书给小陈。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 小陈</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 老师</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 女同学</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The name on the book is Xiao Chen’s.</p><p class="cn">书上写着小陈的名字。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 上面写着小陈的名字</p><ul><li>B: The teacher checks the book but does not own it.<br>老师只是查看书，没有说是老师的。</li><li>C: The girl explicitly says it is not her book.<br>女生明确说这本不是自己的书。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q9"><h3>9. Which item do students NOT need to bring themselves?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m09.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 明天体育课，每人带一瓶水和一条毛巾。不用自己带篮球，学校有。请大家穿运动鞋，准时到操场。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 水</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 篮球</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 毛巾</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The school has basketballs, so students need not bring their own.</p><p class="cn">学校有篮球，因此学生不用自带。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 不用自己带篮球，学校有</p><ul><li>A: Each student is asked to bring a bottle of water.<br>老师要求每人带一瓶水。</li><li>C: Each student is asked to bring a towel.<br>老师要求每人带一条毛巾。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q10"><h3>10. When does the Chinese lesson END?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m10.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 明天中文课几点下课？</p><p class="cn">male · 八点开始，八点四十结束。休息以后，九点上英语课。</p><p class="cn">female · 好，我八点四十来找你。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 八点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 九点</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 八点四十</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>Chinese ends at eight forty.</p><p class="cn">中文课八点四十结束。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 八点四十结束</p><ul><li>A: Eight is when Chinese begins.<br>八点是中文课开始时间。</li><li>B: Nine is when English begins.<br>九点是英语课开始时间。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>L3 · Questions 11–15</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q11"><h3>11. What does the customer ask for?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m11.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 这碗汤已经凉了，能换一碗热的吗？</p><p class="cn">female · 可以，我给您换热汤。</p><p class="cn">male · 谢谢，天气有点儿冷，我想喝热的。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 热汤</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 凉汤</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 冷水</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The customer asks to replace the cool soup with hot soup.</p><p class="cn">顾客要求把凉汤换成热汤。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 能换一碗热的吗</p><ul><li>B: The cool soup is what the customer wants to replace.<br>凉汤是顾客不想继续喝的。</li><li>C: Cold water is not requested.<br>顾客没有要求冷水。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q12"><h3>12. Where will the customer eat the lunch?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m12.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 这份午饭在这儿吃吗？</p><p class="cn">male · 不，我要带回家吃。家里还有人在等我。请帮我装好，筷子我家里有，不用给了。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 店里</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 家里</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 学校</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The customer will take the meal home to eat.</p><p class="cn">顾客要带回家吃。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我要带回家吃</p><ul><li>A: The customer explicitly declines eating here.<br>顾客明确说不在这里吃。</li><li>C: Eating at school is not part of the stated plan.<br>顾客没有说去学校吃。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q13"><h3>13. Which fruit does the speaker buy for herself?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m13.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 妈妈喜欢吃西瓜，爸爸喜欢苹果。我最喜欢橙子。今天我给他们买西瓜和苹果，也给自己买了几个橙子。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 西瓜</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 苹果</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 橙子</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The speaker buys oranges for herself.</p><p class="cn">说话者给自己买橙子。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 也给自己买了几个橙子</p><ul><li>A: Watermelon is for Mum.<br>西瓜是给妈妈买的。</li><li>B: Apples are for Dad.<br>苹果是给爸爸买的。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q14"><h3>14. What is the TOTAL price including the egg?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m14.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 面条八块，加一个鸡蛋一共多少钱？</p><p class="cn">female · 一共十块。</p><p class="cn">male · 好，我给你十块。</p><p class="cn">female · 谢谢，请在旁边等一下。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 十块</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 八块</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 两块</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The seller explicitly gives the total as ten.</p><p class="cn">卖家直接说一共十块。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 一共十块</p><ul><li>B: Eight is the noodles-only price.<br>八块只是面条的价格。</li><li>C: Two is not stated as the total.<br>两块不是对话给出的总价。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q15"><h3>15. Which size does the customer finally choose?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m15.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 这件小号上衣有点儿小。能试试中号吗？</p><p class="cn">male · 可以，这里有中号和大号。</p><p class="cn">female · 中号正好，我就要中号的。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 小号</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 中号</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 大号</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The medium size fits and is selected.</p><p class="cn">顾客说中号正好，决定要中号。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 中号正好，我就要中号的</p><ul><li>A: The small size is too small.<br>小号上衣有点小，顾客没有选它。</li><li>C: Large is offered but not chosen.<br>店员提供大号，但顾客没有选择。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>L4 · Questions 16–20</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q16"><h3>16. What is the FINAL meeting time?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m16.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 我们下午三点见，好吗？</p><p class="cn">female · 我两点半就到了，可以早一点见吗？</p><p class="cn">male · 可以，那我们两点半见，我也早点出门。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 下午三点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午三点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 下午两点半</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>Both agree to the earlier time, two thirty.</p><p class="cn">两人最后同意两点半见。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 那我们两点半见</p><ul><li>A: Three is the original proposal, later changed.<br>三点是最初建议，后来改变了。</li><li>B: Three thirty is not suggested.<br>双方没有提出三点半。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q17"><h3>17. When does the BUS leave?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m17.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 这班车九点开。我们八点半从家里出发，八点四十到车站。到了以后先买票，再一起等车。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 九点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 八点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 八点四十</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>Nine is the stated bus departure time.</p><p class="cn">九点是车开出的时间。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 这班车九点开</p><ul><li>B: Eight thirty is when they leave home.<br>八点半是从家里出发的时间。</li><li>C: Eight forty is when they reach the station.<br>八点四十是到车站的时间。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q18"><h3>18. What color should the TROUSERS be?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m18.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 明天学校活动，我们穿什么衣服？</p><p class="cn">female · 白色上衣、黑色裤子。鞋子没有要求。</p><p class="cn">male · 好，我穿黑裤子和蓝色运动鞋。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 白色</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 黑色</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 蓝色</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The trousers should be black.</p><p class="cn">裤子要求是黑色。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 白色上衣、黑色裤子</p><ul><li>A: White is required for the top.<br>白色是上衣的颜色要求。</li><li>C: Blue describes the boy’s shoes, not the trousers.<br>蓝色指男生的鞋，不是裤子。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q19"><h3>19. What can the speaker do?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m19.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 姐姐很会唱歌，弟弟喜欢画画。我不会唱歌，可是会弹钢琴。周六下午，我们想一起给爸爸妈妈表演。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 弹钢琴</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 唱歌</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 画画</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The speaker says he can play the piano.</p><p class="cn">说话者说自己会弹钢琴。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 可是会弹钢琴</p><ul><li>B: The sister can sing; the speaker says he cannot.<br>姐姐会唱歌，说话者说自己不会。</li><li>C: Drawing is the younger brother’s interest.<br>画画是弟弟的爱好。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q20"><h3>20. What will the boy do TODAY after school?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m20.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 今天放学后一起去游泳吗？</p><p class="cn">male · 今天我不去游泳，我想在家看书。明天再去游泳。</p><p class="cn">female · 好，那我们明天下午见。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 游泳</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 跳舞</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 看书</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>Today he plans to read at home.</p><p class="cn">他今天想在家看书。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 今天我不去游泳，我想在家看书</p><ul><li>A: Swimming is planned for tomorrow.<br>游泳安排在明天。</li><li>B: Dancing is not in the plan.<br>对话没有安排跳舞。</li></ul></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="reading">Reading · 20 minutes</h2><h3>R1 · Questions 21–25</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q21"><h3>21. What do the writer’s FRIENDS call the writer?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">我叫陈乐。老师在学校叫我陈乐，朋友们喜欢叫我“小树”。我喜欢在树下看书，也喜欢和朋友打球。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 小陈</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 陈乐</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 小树</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The friends call the writer Xiaoshu.</p><p class="cn">朋友们喜欢叫作者小树。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 朋友们喜欢叫我“小树”</p><ul><li>A: Xiao Chen is not the nickname given.<br>原文没有给出小陈这个称呼。</li><li>B: The teachers use the full name; the stated friends’ nickname differs.<br>老师使用陈乐这个姓名，朋友的称呼不同。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q22"><h3>22. Who washes the dishes?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">我叫小米。每天晚饭后，爷爷把桌子擦干净，我去洗碗，姐姐把椅子放好。妈妈说，大家一起做就很快。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 爷爷</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 小米</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 姐姐</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The writer, Xiaomi, says “I go wash the dishes.”</p><p class="cn">作者小米说自己去洗碗。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我去洗碗</p><ul><li>A: Grandfather cleans the table.<br>爷爷擦桌子。</li><li>C: The older sister puts the chairs away.<br>姐姐把椅子放好。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q23"><h3>23. Who is this letter addressed to?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">奶奶您好：<br>谢谢您送我的书。我每天晚上都看。星期天我和妈妈去您家吃午饭，想听您讲以前的故事。<br>孙女 小雨</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 奶奶</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 妈妈</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 姐姐</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The greeting addresses Grandmother directly.</p><p class="cn">信的称呼直接写奶奶您好。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 奶奶您好</p><ul><li>B: Mum will accompany the writer but is not the recipient.<br>妈妈会陪作者一起去，但不是收信人。</li><li>C: An older sister is not the addressee.<br>这封信不是写给姐姐的。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q24"><h3>24. Who has NOT started school yet?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">我们家三个孩子。哥哥在大学读书，我在湖光学校上学。妹妹还没上学，每天和奶奶在家。明年她也要去学校了。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 哥哥</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 妹妹</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 说话的人</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The younger sister has not started school yet.</p><p class="cn">原文明确说妹妹还没上学。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 妹妹还没上学</p><ul><li>A: The older brother already attends university.<br>哥哥已经在大学读书。</li><li>C: The writer already attends Huguang School.<br>作者已经在湖光学校上学。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q25"><h3>25. Who will teach Chinese on TUESDAY?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">班级通知<br>王老师星期二请假。那天林老师来上中文课，时间和教室不变。星期三王老师回来。请同学们带好中文书。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 王老师</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 刘老师</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 林老师</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>Teacher Lin will teach the Tuesday lesson.</p><p class="cn">周二中文课由林老师来上。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 那天林老师来上中文课</p><ul><li>A: Teacher Wang is away on Tuesday and returns Wednesday.<br>王老师周二请假，周三才回来。</li><li>B: Teacher Liu is not mentioned.<br>通知没有提到刘老师。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>R2 · Questions 26–30</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q26"><h3>26. Who should receive students’ homework FIRST?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">同学们：<br>星期三上课前，请把作业本交给小何。小何收好以后送到老师办公室。小林负责拿新本子。不要把作业放在讲台上。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 小林</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 小何</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 老师</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>Students first hand their work to Xiaohe.</p><p class="cn">通知要求先把作业本交给小何。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 请把作业本交给小何</p><ul><li>A: Xiaolin collects new notebooks, not the submitted homework.<br>小林负责拿新本子，不是先收作业。</li><li>C: The teacher receives it only after Xiaohe collects it.<br>老师是在小何收齐以后收到作业。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q27"><h3>27. What is DIRECTLY opposite the school gate?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">从学校大门往前看：<br>左边是食堂，右边是办公室，大门对面是图书馆。图书馆后面是教室，新同学请先到办公室。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 食堂</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 办公室</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 图书馆</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The library directly faces the gate.</p><p class="cn">图书馆正对学校大门。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 大门对面是图书馆</p><ul><li>A: The canteen is on the left.<br>食堂在左边。</li><li>B: The office is on the right.<br>办公室在右边。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q28"><h3>28. Which activity is allowed INSIDE the reading room?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">阅览室小提示<br>这里可以安静看书，不可以吃东西，也不要大声说话。手机请关声音，放进包里。出去吃完东西以后可以再进来。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 安静看书</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 吃东西</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 大声说话</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>Quiet reading is explicitly allowed.</p><p class="cn">提示明确允许安静看书。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 这里可以安静看书</p><ul><li>B: Eating inside is explicitly prohibited in the notice.<br>提示明确说室内不可以吃东西。</li><li>C: The notice says not to speak loudly.<br>提示说不要大声说话。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q29"><h3>29. Who owns the RED SCHOOLBAG?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">放学后留下的东西<br>蓝帽子：小林。<br>红书包：小何。<br>黑外套：小康。<br>都放在老师桌子下面，请明天来拿。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 小林</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 小何</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 小康</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>Xiaohe is the labelled owner of the red schoolbag.</p><p class="cn">红书包对应小何。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 红书包：小何</p><ul><li>A: Xiaolin owns the blue hat.<br>小林的物品是蓝帽子。</li><li>C: Xiaokang owns the black coat.<br>小康的物品是黑外套。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q30"><h3>30. When does the SINGING activity start?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">本周放学后的安排<br>周一15:00：画画。<br>周四15:30：唱歌。<br>周五14:00：看书。<br>每次活动一个小时，请提前五分钟到。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 周一下午三点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 周五下午两点</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 周四下午三点半</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>Singing starts Thursday at three thirty.</p><p class="cn">唱歌活动周四下午三点半开始。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 周四15:30：唱歌</p><ul><li>A: Monday at three is the drawing activity.<br>周一三点是画画活动。</li><li>B: Friday at two is the reading activity.<br>周五两点是看书活动。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>R3 · Questions 31–35</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q31"><h3>31. Which set includes RICE and VEGETABLES?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">今日午饭<br>一号：米饭和青菜。<br>二号：面条和牛肉。<br>三号：包子和鸡肉。<br>每份都有一杯热水，请先选好再点餐。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 一号</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 二号</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 三号</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>Set One lists rice and vegetables.</p><p class="cn">一号套餐列的是米饭和青菜。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 一号：米饭和青菜</p><ul><li>B: Set Two has noodles and beef.<br>二号套餐是面条和牛肉。</li><li>C: Set Three has buns and chicken.<br>三号套餐是包子和鸡肉。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q32"><h3>32. Which drink should Xiaolu BUY?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小陆：<br>家里的茶还有很多，水也够。牛奶已经喝完了，请今天买两盒牛奶回来。不要买别的饮料。<br>妈妈</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 茶</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 牛奶</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 水</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>Milk has run out and is explicitly requested.</p><p class="cn">牛奶喝完了，妈妈明确要求购买。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 请今天买两盒牛奶回来</p><ul><li>A: There is already plenty of tea.<br>家里还有很多茶。</li><li>C: There is enough water already.<br>家里的水已经够了。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q33"><h3>33. At which time can you buy BREAKFAST on Monday?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小店营业时间<br>早餐：早上七点到九点半。<br>午饭：上午十一点开始。<br>九点半到十一点不卖饭，只卖水。周日不开门。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 上午十点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 上午十一点</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 上午九点</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>Nine is within the seven-to-nine-thirty breakfast hours.</p><p class="cn">九点在七点到九点半的早餐营业时段内。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 早餐：早上七点到九点半</p><ul><li>A: Ten is in the water-only interval.<br>十点属于只卖水的时段。</li><li>B: Eleven is when lunch begins, after breakfast ends.<br>十一点开始卖午饭，早餐已结束。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q34"><h3>34. At which window should a customer collect HOT TEA?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">取餐提示<br>一号窗口取米饭，二号窗口取面条，三号窗口取饮料。热茶和牛奶也在三号窗口，请带好小票。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 三号窗口</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 一号窗口</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 二号窗口</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The notice explicitly places hot tea at Window Three.</p><p class="cn">提示明确说热茶在三号窗口。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 热茶和牛奶也在三号窗口</p><ul><li>B: Window One is for rice.<br>一号窗口取米饭。</li><li>C: Window Two is for noodles.<br>二号窗口取面条。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q35"><h3>35. How many pairs of SOCKS should be packed?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">去奶奶家住两天<br>请带：上衣两件，裤子一条，袜子三双。<br>奶奶家有毛巾，不用带。把干净衣服放在蓝色包里。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 两双</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 三双</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 一双</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The packing list specifies three pairs of socks.</p><p class="cn">清单要求带袜子三双。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 袜子三双</p><ul><li>A: Two is the number of tops, not pairs of socks.<br>两件是上衣数量，不是袜子数量。</li><li>C: One refers to the trousers, not the socks.<br>一条指裤子，不是袜子。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>R4 · Questions 36–40</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q36"><h3>36. When does the film start according to the NEW ticket?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">周六看电影<br>旧票：下午四点开始。<br>新票：下午五点开始，四点半可以进去。<br>小田说：请带新票，别拿旧票。地点没有变。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 下午四点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午四点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 下午五点</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The new ticket gives five as the starting time.</p><p class="cn">新票写下午五点开始。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 新票：下午五点开始</p><ul><li>A: Four is printed on the old ticket.<br>四点是旧票上的开始时间。</li><li>B: Four thirty is the entry time, not the film start.<br>四点半是可以进去的时间，不是开始放映时间。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q37"><h3>37. When does the writer get up on SUNDAY?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">我平时六点半起床，七点吃早饭。星期天不用上学，我八点才起床，八点半和爸爸一起吃早饭，然后看书。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 八点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 六点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 八点半</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The Sunday waking time is eight.</p><p class="cn">星期天八点才起床。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 星期天不用上学，我八点才起床</p><ul><li>B: Six thirty is the usual waking time on other days.<br>六点半是平时起床时间。</li><li>C: Eight thirty is Sunday breakfast time.<br>八点半是星期天吃早饭时间。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q38"><h3>38. Which shoes are requested for TUESDAY?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">本周穿衣提示<br>周二体育课：运动鞋。<br>周三唱歌表演：黑色皮鞋。<br>老师说，鞋子要干净，别把两天的安排记错。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 黑色皮鞋</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 运动鞋</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 拖鞋</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>Tuesday’s PE lesson requires sports shoes in this notice.</p><p class="cn">通知要求周二体育课穿运动鞋。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 周二体育课：运动鞋</p><ul><li>A: Black leather shoes are for Wednesday’s performance.<br>黑色皮鞋用于周三唱歌表演。</li><li>C: Slippers are not requested for either day.<br>提示没有要求穿拖鞋。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q39"><h3>39. What is the NEW activity on Sunday?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">周日活动改了：<br>因为下雨，不去公园打篮球了。我们下午三点在小方家听音乐。时间不变，想来的朋友请给小方发消息。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 去公园</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 打篮球</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 听音乐</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The new indoor plan is listening to music.</p><p class="cn">新安排是在小方家听音乐。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我们下午三点在小方家听音乐</p><ul><li>A: Going to the park is the cancelled plan.<br>去公园的计划取消了。</li><li>B: Basketball is explicitly no longer the activity.<br>通知明确说不打篮球了。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q40"><h3>40. What should participants BRING for the drawing activity?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">画画小组<br>周六上午九点在公园见。请自己带纸和笔，老师带颜色。画完后大家可以看别人的画，不用准备食物。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 纸和笔</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 球</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 食物</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>Participants are explicitly asked to bring paper and pens.</p><p class="cn">通知明确要求自带纸和笔。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 请自己带纸和笔</p><ul><li>B: A ball is not requested for the drawing group.<br>画画活动没有要求带球。</li><li>C: The notice says food does not need to be prepared.<br>通知说明不用准备食物。</li></ul></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="writing">Writing · 15 minutes</h2><p>Both tasks share 15 minutes. Write on paper or in your own text editor. This review page does not save answers.</p><section class="box" id="W1"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W1</p><h2>Reply to an outdoor drawing invitation</h2><p>Reply in Chinese to your classmate. Say whether you can join the Sunday drawing activity, give a time or another day that works, and ask one question about the activity. About 20-40 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum. You may invent your schedule.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">小陆：你好！周日下午一起去公园画画，好吗？你一点还是两点有空？<br>小陶</p></div><div class="key"><h3>Illustrative response - other valid responses are possible</h3><p class="cn">小陶，你好！周日可以，我两点有空。我们要带什么东西？</p></div><ul><li>Respond to the Sunday invitation.</li><li>Give a workable time or an alternative day.</li><li>Ask one question relevant to the drawing activity.</li></ul><h3>Alternative example</h3><p class="cn">你好！周日我有事，周六两点可以吗？我们在哪个公园见？</p><ul><li>Accepting or declining with an alternative can meet the task.</li><li>A question about supplies, meeting point, park or weather arrangements is relevant.</li><li>Invented details are acceptable. Do not penalize a response solely for being shorter than the suggested range.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="W2"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W2</p><h2>Introduce a student and a Tuesday lesson</h2><p>Use BOTH parts of the fictional information below to introduce Chen Miao in Chinese. Include name and age, school and the Tuesday class starting time, and at least one preference. About 40-70 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum. Simple connected sentences are enough.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">学生卡<br>陈苗，十五岁，湖光学校。<br>喜欢：跳舞、牛奶。不喜欢：茶。<br><br>周二上午课表<br>9:15—10:00：中文课。<br>10:15—11:00：数学课。</p></div><div class="key"><h3>Illustrative response - other valid responses are possible</h3><p class="cn">这位同学叫陈苗，今年十五岁，在湖光学校上学。星期二上午九点十五分开始上中文课。陈苗喜欢跳舞，也喜欢喝牛奶，不喜欢喝茶。</p></div><ul><li>Identify Chen Miao by name and age.</li><li>Give the school and the Chinese lesson starting time on Tuesday.</li><li>State at least one preference consistent with the card.</li></ul><ul><li>The required class time is the Chinese lesson start, not the mathematics start or an ending time.</li><li>Use the name without inferring gender.</li><li>Any one stated preference meets that requirement; do not require every timetable entry.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="speaking">Speaking · 10 minutes</h2><section class="box" id="S1"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S1</p><h2>Talk about school and make a plan</h2><p>Answer four recorded prompts in Chinese. Each plays twice, followed by 10 seconds to prepare and up to 20 seconds to record. Real or invented details are acceptable. All four responses form ONE /8 task. These are fixed prompts, not an adaptive conversation.</p><p>A classmate asks about your school, clothing preferences and weekend routine, then invites you to sing together.</p><h3>Prompt S1-1</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-1.mp3"></audio><p class="cn">你在哪个学校上学？你是哪个班的学生？</p><p class="cn">Example: 我在湖光学校上学，在三班。</p><h3>Prompt S1-2</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-2.mp3"></audio><p class="cn">你喜欢什么颜色？喜欢穿什么衣服？</p><p class="cn">Example: 我喜欢绿色，喜欢穿绿色的上衣。</p><h3>Prompt S1-3</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-3.mp3"></audio><p class="cn">周末你几点吃午饭？吃完饭做什么？</p><p class="cn">Example: 我十二点吃午饭，吃完饭以后看书。</p><h3>Prompt S1-4</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-4.mp3"></audio><p class="cn">星期六一起唱歌，好吗？我们在哪儿见面？</p><p class="cn">Example: 好啊，我们在学校门口见吧。</p><p class="note">Each audio prompt plays twice. After it ends, allow 10 seconds to prepare and 20 seconds to record using your own recording app. Four responses = one task /8.</p><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="S2"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S2</p><h2>Describe a student’s Tuesday</h2><p>Use the fictional note to describe Xu Xing’s Tuesday in Chinese. Include who the student is, the school and at least one class time, and the after-school activity. You have 60 seconds to prepare and up to 60 seconds to speak. No minimum recording length is enforced.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">许星的周二<br>学校：湖光学校<br>7:45：到学校<br>8:10：开始上课<br>12:00：和朋友吃午饭<br>16:30：下课<br>下课后：在音乐教室和同学唱歌</p></div><div class="key"><h3>Illustrative response - other valid responses are possible</h3><p class="cn">这是许星的星期二。许星在湖光学校上学，七点四十五到学校，八点十分开始上课。中午和朋友吃饭。下午四点半下课以后，许星在音乐教室和同学唱歌。</p></div><ul><li>Identify Xu Xing.</li><li>Give the school and at least one class time.</li><li>Describe the after-school activity in the note.</li></ul><ul><li>Arrival at 7:45 and lessons starting at 8:10 are different facts.</li><li>Give the class start or end time to meet the class-time requirement; not every time is required.</li><li>Simple intelligible sentences are sufficient; do not grade by accent similarity or by filling the whole minute.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box"><h2>Self / teacher review rubric</h2><p>Four dimensions × 0–2 points = /8 per task. Review S1 as one complete four-response task. No combined percentage, pass line, official equivalence or included teacher-marking service.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>0</th><th>1</th><th>2</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>任务完成</td><td>无相关可评内容。</td><td>回应部分要求，遗漏关键信息。</td><td>以初阶表达回应主要要求。</td></tr><tr><td>可理解性</td><td>大部分意思无法恢复。</td><td>部分需借助上下文猜测。</td><td>主要意思能够理解。</td></tr><tr><td>基础语言运用</td><td>缺少可用于表达目标意思的中文。</td><td>有限词句传达部分意思，错误有时干扰。</td><td>简单词句基本适合情境，允许初阶错误。</td></tr><tr><td>组织／相关回应</td><td>缺乏可辨关系或相关回应。</td><td>有部分顺序或相关回应。</td><td>简单但连贯，回应相关、易于跟随。</td></tr></tbody></table></section></main></body></html>